flowchart TD
  A([User opens app]) --> B{Has valid session?}
  B -->|Yes| C[Show dashboard]
  B -->|No| D[Show login form]
  D --> E["Submit credentials (HTTPS)"]
  E --> F{Credentials valid?}
  F -->|Yes| G[Issue JWT + refresh token]
  F -->|No| H[Show error, count attempt]
  H --> I{Attempts > 5?}
  I -->|Yes| J[Lock account 15 min]
  I -->|No| D
  G --> C
